    <!-- Live user request: replace the hand-drawn hammer with a real
         pictogram (user-supplied file, hammer-tool-svgrepo-com.svg from svgrepo.com), and give
         fixes/refactorings/conversions their own distinct icons instead of one hammer for every
         lightbulb menu entry (see CodeFixMargin's own CodeFixCategory/Categorize). Source viewBox is
         0 0 32 32, not this file's usual 24×24 — left as-is rather than rescaled: PathIcon stretches
         Uniform to whatever box it's drawn in regardless of the geometry's own native coordinate
         range (confirmed against the existing 24×24 icons rendering correctly at 16px), so the two
         conventions coexist fine in one file. -->
