    <!-- Refactorings' own icon (a broom, "cleanup"), separate from fixes' hammer
         above. User-supplied file, clean-svgrepo-com.svg from svgrepo.com (viewBox 0 0 32 32, same
         as the hammer above). Source is one <path> plus three small <rect> "sparkle" marks; each
         rect's own transform="translate(...) rotate(-180)" is a geometric no-op
         (rotating a rectangle 180° around its own center, verified by hand — the reflection point
         each translate() implies is exactly that rect's center in every one of the three cases) —
         converted to plain M/L/Z subpaths at their untransformed x/y/width/height instead of carrying
         the transform math into the combined string. The source's own invisible
         "_Transparent_Rectangle_" bounding box (fill:none, canvas-size bookkeeping only) is dropped —
         nothing in this file's other icons carries one either. -->
    <StreamGeometry x:Key="Icon.Broom">M17.0029,20a4.8952,4.8952,0,0,0-2.4044-4.1729L22,3,20.2691,2,12.6933,15.126A5.6988,5.6988,0,0,0,7.45,16.6289C3.7064,20.24,3.9963,28.6821,4.01,29.04a1,1,0,0,0,1,.96H20.0012a1,1,0,0,0,.6-1.8C17.0615,25.5439,17.0029,20.0537,17.0029,20ZM11.93,16.9971A3.11,3.11,0,0,1,15.0041,20c0,.0381.0019.208.0168.4688L9.1215,17.8452A3.8,3.8,0,0,1,11.93,16.9971ZM15.4494,28A5.2,5.2,0,0,1,14,25H12a6.4993,6.4993,0,0,0,.9684,3H10.7451A16.6166,16.6166,0,0,1,10,24H8a17.3424,17.3424,0,0,0,.6652,4H6c.031-1.8364.29-5.8921,1.8027-8.5527l7.533,3.35A13.0253,13.0253,0,0,0,17.5968,28Z M20,18 L26,18 L26,20 L20,20 Z M24,26 L30,26 L30,28 L24,28 Z M22,22 L28,22 L28,24 L22,24 Z</StreamGeometry>

    <!-- Conversions/minor edits' own icon (a wrench), separate from fixes/
         refactorings above. User-supplied file, wrench-svgrepo-com.svg from svgrepo.com (viewBox
         0 0 24 24 — this file's usual convention). Source uses
         fill-rule="evenodd" (the two ring-shaped openings at the wrench's jaw ends are cut out by two
         overlapping subpaths, not separate holes) — "F0" is the path mini-language's own EvenOdd
         fill-rule directive (mirrors WPF/SVG; "F1", the default, is NonZero), needed here or those
         two openings would fill in solid instead of reading as a wrench. -->
